      "role": "user",
      "content": "Oops, dit is +4. So 3x^2 - 13x + 4 = 16. Dan 3x^2 - 13x - 12 = 0. Nou gebruik ek die kwadratiese formule: x = [-(-13) ± sqrt((-13)^2 - 4*3*(-12))] / (2*3) = [13 ± sqrt(169 + 144)] / 6 = [13 ± sqrt(313)] / 6. sqrt(313) ≈ 17,69. Dus x ≈ (13 + 17,69)/6 ≈ 5,12 of x ≈ (13 - 17,69)/6 ≈ -0,78."
